      "text": "Inkling 2 Small is a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) large language model developed by Thinking Machines Lab. It contains 594 billion total parameters with 17 billion active per forward pass, accepts both text and image inputs, and offers variable inference effort. Released in 2025, it was pre-trained from scratch in under 68 hours on fewer than 12 trillion tokens using NVFP4 precision and a single joint reinforcement-learning run, achieving a score of 31 on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index."
